[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_STEAM]
Steampunk Light Tank (Light Tank)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_STEAM_desc]
Although propelling a tank or a cannon with steam is quite a novel idea, ponies have been familiar with tanks and cannons for quite some time. The only confusing question is that, why did nopony ever think of using them as a war machine before? Shooting celebratory confetti from a cannon is a common practice, but shooting a cannon from a cannon is a courageous act. How come?
§g“The difference of these two purposes is like you sharing a picture of your house, versus some complete stranger sharing you a picture, of your house.”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_STEAM_short]
Steampunk Light Tank

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_STEAM]
轻型蒸汽坦克 (轻型坦克)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_STEAM_desc]
虽然用蒸汽驱动坦克或大炮是一个相当新颖的想法，但小马们已经熟悉坦克和大炮相当长一段时间了。唯一令人困惑的问题是，为什么之前没有小马想到将它们用作战争机器？用加农炮发射庆祝彩纸屑是一种常见的做法，但用加农炮发射加农炮弹却是一种有魄力的行为。怎么会这样？
§g“这两种使用方法的区别，就好比是你展示了一张你自己住处的照片，和一个完全陌生者展示给你了一张你住处的照片的区别。”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_TANK_LIGHT_STEAM_short]
轻型蒸汽坦克
